//! Generated pushdown (explicit-stack) parser - DO NOT EDIT
//!
//! Generated by descent (`--backend pushdown`) from the same grammar as
//! the sibling recursive parser. Resumable at any byte boundary: feed
//! with `push_chunk`, close with `finish`. Emits the sibling's
//! `StreamEvent`s with global spans. Content is borrowed from the
//! parser's accumulation buffer where safe (`Cow::Borrowed`), owned
//! only where a buffer drain would invalidate it (PREPEND-combined
//! content, SAVE-slot re-emission). Delivery contract: a borrowed
//! event is valid only during the callback that receives it — copy
//! (`into_owned`) anything that must survive past the callback or
//! the next `push_chunk`.

